WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.312
BEFORE. An empty balloon is small.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.080
INFLATE. Air enters and makes the balloon larger.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.717
MOVE. A paper flag bends when air blows.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.635
EXPLAIN. Invisible air takes up space and can move things.
